{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-12T21:14:03.364Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6cac702086723f6d9ab0b467","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1710","claim:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1710+pm-n98pir","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1710","claim:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-7ivxas"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Identity refusal table omits linked-test updated_by and plan step owner, so those identity locations still accept URL userinfo"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Found by the Codex review of PR 1714 (final round). After pm-ziv9yb, the URL-userinfo identity refusal judges the top-level author, assignee and claim_principal and a declared table of nested identity paths (comments, notes, learnings, dependencies, plan_decisions and plan_discoveries author, and the linked-test provenance author). Two identity locations in src/types.ts are not in the table: a linked test's updated_by (the author of its most recent metadata edit) and a plan step's owner. Both were unchecked before PR 1714 as well, so this is a gap in coverage rather than a regression. A runtime or registered field mapped onto tests or plan_steps can therefore store one of those identities with URL userinfo. Fix: add both entry paths to the declared table and pin them in the url-credentials spec."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["identity","redaction","runtime-fields","security"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-12T21:14:03.364Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-12T21:14:03.364Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":30},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A tests entry updated_by or a plan_steps entry owner carrying URL userinfo is refused naming its entry path; The url-credentials spec pins both paths next to the existing declared paths"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-qwoy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Every identity location in the item types is judged"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"tests updated_by and plan_steps owner are not judged"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-ziv9yb","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-12T21:14:03.364Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"bd6cbf9e1b88ae7cb92b6d6184579e75dff767a06bd9b9db485711a7693e07a5","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"93721e630f9777a17dc56f2a2a39794e1f1f3d2410b905995f9b90f356b6ab67"}
